description=Local web hotspot management for rooted Android (KernelSU). Hotspot control, traffic quota, client management, MAC blacklist/whitelist, scheduling, SMS forward, Mihomo proxy, PushPlus/DingTalk/Bark notifications, hidden SSID, device diagnostics. Generic Android compatibility via Hotspot Compatibility Layer (capability-driven; system WifiConfigStore.xml as single source of truth). Verified: Xiaomi 14 / HyperOS 3 / Android 16 / KernelSU. v1.7.6-beta: one-config with system hotspot settings, Hotspot Compatibility Layer (7 unified APIs), 6GHz support.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chenchaosuperman-cell/Android-Hotspot-Web/main/update.json
